name twoup
category Package
revision 15878
catalogue twoupltx
shortdesc Print two virtual pages on each physical page
relocated 1
longdesc MiKTeX and many other TeX implementations include tools for
longdesc massaging PostScript into booklet and two-up printing -- that
longdesc is, printing two logical pages side by side on one side of one
longdesc sheet of paper. However, some LaTeX preliminaries are necessary
longdesc to use those tools. The twoup package provides such
longdesc preliminaries and gives advice on how to use the PostScript
longdesc tools.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/twoup/twoup.sty
catalogue-also twoinone
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/twoup
